                "自然语言处理：应用",
                "针对序列级和词元级应用微调BERT",
                "单文本分类"
              ],
              "lineStart": 15611,
              "lineEnd": 15620,
              "assetRefs": [
                "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/d2l-ai/d2l-zh/e6b18ccea71451a55fcd861d7b96fddf2587b09a/img/bert-one-seq.svg"
              ],
              "excerptSha256": "858982a69ca327efd425655a96d39eb1b754fb4bb6a3469c393f54b18150b20e"
            }
          ]
        }
